WEBVTT

00:16:56.814 --> 00:17:00.042
her husband murdered
their kids and himself.

00:17:00.066 --> 00:17:03.410
She came home one Sunday evening
and found the bodies.

00:17:03.434 --> 00:17:06.099
I can't imagine a worse thing.

00:17:06.123 --> 00:17:07.758
And she decided,

00:17:07.782 --> 00:17:10.813
"Whatever that guy tried to do to me,
he's not going to do it.

00:17:10.837 --> 00:17:13.268
I'm going to lead a life
of purpose and meaning."

00:17:13.292 --> 00:17:18.009
She operates, in part, out of anger,
that "He's not going to ruin my life."

00:17:18.033 --> 00:17:21.162
So now she works at a free pharmacy
giving away pharmaceuticals.

00:17:21.186 --> 00:17:23.274
She teaches kids. She has a foundation.

00:17:23.298 --> 00:17:25.785
She leads a life of selfless service.

00:17:25.809 --> 00:17:28.606
And a lot of people I've met
around the country

00:17:28.630 --> 00:17:30.241
in the last year of the travels